{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"## Implemented, merged, and closed — evidence\n\n**Design chosen (per operator ruling + OSS grounding).** Create-time, advisory-only,\nsame-normalized-title duplicate surfacing — the shape GitHub/GitLab (filing-time similar-issue\nsurfacing) and Kubernetes / VS Code triage bots (flag immediately after creation, never block)\nuse. Implemented as a bounded O(window) probe, not an O(store) scan: a rolling\n`recent-creates.json` sidecar journal (600 s window, ~3.5x the 171 s max observed true-duplicate\ndelta) probed inside `create_core` under a dedicated `fcntl.flock` (the `_hlc_lock` pattern), so\nconcurrent creates serialize and the later observes the earlier. Gated on the existing\n`verify.suggest_duplicate_tickets` key. Operation-linked/in-process (CLI, library, MCP, `idea()`\nall funnel through `create_core`) — no CI dependency.\n\n**AC #1 (recorded).** `rebar create` does NOT consult the overlap detector: before this change\n`create_core` (`src/rebar/_commands/composer.py:113-281`) performed only channel/type/title/\npriority/init/parent checks — no `rebar.llm.overlap` import (confirmed by the Phase-1\ninvestigation and re-verified this session). The create-time probe now lives at\n`src/rebar/_commands/composer.py` -> `rebar._commands.recent_creates.duplicate_create_warning`,\ncalled immediately after `append_event`.\n\n**AC #2/#3 (surfaced, non-blocking).** RED-first evidence: the new test\n`tests/unit/test_create_duplicate_warning.py` failed with `KeyError: 'duplicate_warning'`\nbefore the implementation, then all 12 tests passed after — covering: same-title warns with\ncandidate id + status on library/CLI(`create` + `idea`)/MCP surfaces; distinct titles silent;\ncase/punctuation/whitespace normalization; stale-window silence; flag-off = silent + zero\njournal footprint; corrupt journal never disturbs the write; warned create still succeeds\n(exit 0); two concurrent same-title creates serialize so one observes the other.\n\n**AC #4 (duplicates links).** Sanctioned alternative executed:\n- `elfish-saltwater-pika` already carried `duplicates -> 5a90-ec98-af5a-48d0` (recorded earlier).\n- `decagonal-indisposed-tamarin`: reopen -> `link baeb-4f4b-3227-457e 039b-d179-b669-4439\n  duplicates` -> re-close `--class duplicate` executed this session; the ticket now ends closed\n  WITH the machine-readable link.\n\n**AC #5 (gates).** `make lint` PASS, `make typecheck` PASS (640 files),\n`check_complexity_baseline.py --check`: active=43 new=0 increased=0 (stale=6 pre-existing).\n\n**Landed.** Gerrit change 2147, LLM-Review +1 (rebar review bot), Verified +1 (rebar CI bot),\n0 unresolved comments; submitted; merged into main as `55020dff94cca12410cac17cc258d4447d9af828`\n(\"Warn about same-title duplicates at create\")."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1787465554493169001,"uuid":"d9d76d84-99ce-45aa-97ee-9bc02a75e395"}